<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LastTheWord — A Word-Chain Game</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Every word must begin with the letter the last one ended on. LastTheWord is a fast, offline word-chain game with Endless and Blitz modes.">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0d12;
            --card-bg: #141721;
            --text-main: #e2e8f0;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --accent-color: #38bdf8;
            --accent-color-2: #a78bfa;
            --border-color: #1e293b;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 40px 20px 80px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .hero {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .eyebrow {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .tagline {
            margin-top: 16px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 560px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .chain {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-main);
            word-spacing: 4px;
        }

        .chain span {
            color: var(--accent-color-2);
        }

        .cta-row {
            margin-top: 32px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: #0b0d12;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #7dd3fc;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: var(--text-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        section.card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 32px 36px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding-left: 10px;
        }

        p {
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .modes {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .mode {
            background-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .mode h3 {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .mode p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        footer a {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 16px 8px 60px;
            }
            .hero {
                padding: 32px 20px;
            }
            h1 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            section.card {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }
            .modes {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Word-Chain Game</p>
        <h1>LastTheWord</h1>
        <p class="tagline">
            Every word must begin with the letter the last one ended on. That is the whole rule, and it is the last simple thing about it.
        </p>
        <p class="chain">apple <span>&rarr;</span> elephant <span>&rarr;</span> train <span>&rarr;</span> nest</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">Get it on the App Store</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/lasttheword/privacy_policy">Privacy Policy</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <p>
            The clock is running. A longer word scores more. A rarer word scores more still. A streak multiplies everything —
            and every word you get right shaves a little more time off the next turn, so a good run gets harder precisely
            because it is going well.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>Two ways to play</h2>
        <div class="modes">
            <div class="mode">
                <h3>Endless</h3>
                <p>Three lives, and a per-turn clock that tightens as you go. See how far your streak can carry you.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mode">
                <h3>Blitz</h3>
                <p>One 60-second clock for the whole run. Every valid word buys more of it. Fast, tense, and over in a minute.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>LastTheWord by <a href="/">Rıdvan Topal</a> · <a href="/lasttheword/privacy_policy">Privacy Policy</a></p>
    </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
